      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `aa403678cca275d8db383f19a248e6250924558aab6e83ae8d68d30a32934c11--45300do013_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 306dfa9b930f46d23c5330a577783373b51e109d350740195aaedfee2b1c410e | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | ac60e45f5f8c1c70612e9861d403ca7acf24c6eabc78de0367f5f8d5dd22dcd8 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 77ab85535003bb279168baf33433a3c4ccc19a44c3aee26f074bdd9b2656976f | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 3559f8ee8438333f4db26d4481c04b8050edac81c8239cddc0470a8e45e79871 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | ab2fdaf62521bbe8bfd6909135a4f1397900c3f6fee288ef8e2f21204a045fd2 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 50e576d84c82f855f16f877be6b0721fc81b23812b4acdd79f019a9bcdb092db | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 3b82c54a095142ac17fd9c82f447ec477676e0ae23d4ed290f3e97f5eef8f3d2 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | f5b8f8f45a747afa35c22475c6e9b01cb6533f5d5654a7e544b676095e5101ef | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 9441df7d97b6d00c75b60c0cb4b22503dc534e305288b150bbea3a2863a2b7e5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
